<title>ITALY: Venice airport air cargo up 8.6 pct in April '97.</title>
<headline>Venice airport air cargo up 8.6 pct in April '97.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Total cargo traffic at Venice's Marco Polo airport rose in April by 8.6 percent to 1,196 tonnes against the same period of 1996, the airport's managing authority SAVE said.</p>
<p>			    Apr 97     Pct	Jan-Apr 97  Pct</p>
<p>					  Change		    Change</p>
<p> Cargo (Tonnes)	  1,196     up 8.6	4,682   up 5.0</p>
<p> Aircraft movements    3,432     up 8.8     12,820   up 4.7</p>
<p> Passengers	    243,415     up 0.3    826,321   up 7.4</p>
<p>- Reuters Air Cargo Newsroom Tel+44 171 542 7706 Fax:5017 Friday, 21 March 1997 16:14:40</p>
